	---help---
		Enable the RZ/V2H ADC-E lower-half driver for ADC unit 0.
		Select ANI000 through ANI007 in the ADC0 channel selection menu.

if RZV2H_ADC

menu "ADC0 channel selection"

config RZV2H_ADC0_ANI000
	bool "ANI000"
	default y
	---help---
		Include dedicated analog input ANI000 in ADC0 group-A scans.

