	int "Number of Buffers"
	default 0
	range 0 96
	---help---
		Number of message buffers available for reception. As there
		is no interrupt for message buffer reception it is
		recommended to use RX FIFOs instead. Set this value to 0
		to disable RX Message Buffers.

